00:04:59.616 --> 00:05:01.769
- [Voiceover] Zac asks,
"What three questions

00:05:01.769 --> 00:05:03.514
"do you most commonly ask your clients

00:05:03.514 --> 00:05:05.713
"when meeting them for the first time?"

00:05:05.713 --> 00:05:07.251
