00:05:07.251 --> 00:05:09.159
For everybody in client
services, agency life,

00:05:09.159 --> 00:05:10.311
this should be fun.

00:05:10.311 --> 00:05:11.948
Number one is what is your KPI?

00:05:11.948 --> 00:05:13.590
What's your Key Performance Indicator?

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.634
Like what is the thing that
you want us to accomplish?

00:05:16.634 --> 00:05:19.850
Is it views, is it
sales, is it perception,

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:22.919
is it press, is it your own judgement

00:05:22.919 --> 00:05:25.148
on how you feel about the creative?

00:05:25.148 --> 00:05:27.817
How are you judging us,
what are the results?

00:05:27.817 --> 00:05:28.740
And they're really separate.

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:30.856
How are you judging us,
what are the results

00:05:30.856 --> 00:05:34.216
are number one A and one
B that matters the most,

00:05:34.216 --> 00:05:36.788
and then, really, the
third one would then be

00:05:36.788 --> 00:05:40.686
what are you willing to
tell me about your warts?

00:05:40.686 --> 00:05:42.049
Meaning, there's just a lot of people

00:05:42.049 --> 00:05:43.455
that are not gonna tell you about,

00:05:43.455 --> 00:05:45.313
the politics that are an issue,

00:05:45.313 --> 00:05:46.706
the money that's an issue.

00:05:46.706 --> 00:05:49.764
I'm always trying to get them
to be very truthful to us

00:05:49.764 --> 00:05:52.004
once I understand what
the issues at hand are,

00:05:52.004 --> 00:05:53.984
so what do you really want to accomplish?

00:05:53.984 --> 00:05:56.189
By the way, people struggle
with answering that.

00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:57.528
People struggle with answering that.

00:05:57.528 --> 00:05:59.921
Number two, how are you gonna judge me?

00:05:59.921 --> 00:06:01.678
Sometimes they struggle with that less.

00:06:01.678 --> 00:06:03.501
Number three, what are the warts?

00:06:03.501 --> 00:06:05.206
Most people don't wanna tell me up front.

00:06:05.206 --> 00:06:08.189
We try to sniff them out
early so we can navigate them,

00:06:08.189 --> 00:06:12.108
and it's like a minefield
to get to the finish line.

00:06:12.108 --> 00:06:13.656
Those are the three,

00:06:13.656 --> 00:06:15.906
and they're very important questions,

00:06:15.906 --> 00:06:18.408
and trying to figure
out in every situation,

00:06:18.408 --> 00:06:19.655
in absolutely every situation,

00:06:19.655 --> 00:06:23.281
in dating, in building your own
business, in having clients.

00:06:23.281 --> 00:06:27.540
I really think those three
are super fun, and by the way,

00:06:28.045 --> 00:06:29.594
they're very important equally.

00:06:29.594 --> 00:06:30.841
I think, for example,

00:06:30.841 --> 00:06:32.426
I think people that struggle with dating

00:06:32.426 --> 00:06:34.312
are spending way too much on number three.

00:06:34.312 --> 00:06:36.600
They're so concerned about
what the person's warts are,

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:38.313
or skeletons in their closets.

00:06:38.313 --> 00:06:39.979
They're not trying to figure
out how they're being judged

00:06:39.979 --> 00:06:41.811
to be a good partner in that relationship,

00:06:41.811 --> 00:06:43.934
or how that's gonna be scored, and so,

00:06:43.934 --> 00:06:45.669
having a great balance of all three.

00:06:45.669 --> 00:06:47.497
That's a little nugget there.

00:06:47.497 --> 00:06:49.799
Give you a little fun fact
at the end of this question.

00:06:49.799 --> 00:06:52.590
It's the 33% execution
