own family's business

00:11:34.525 --> 00:11:36.291
and doing your own thing.

00:11:36.291 --> 00:11:37.489
Hopefully it's not competing directly

00:11:37.489 --> 00:11:38.690
with your own family's business,

00:11:38.690 --> 00:11:40.805
so there's not some weirdness.

00:11:40.805 --> 00:11:43.683
I think the thing that you
really need to pay attention to

00:11:43.683 --> 00:11:46.887
is you have made a decision

00:11:46.887 --> 00:11:49.412
that does not allow you, in year one,

00:11:49.412 --> 00:11:52.466
