00:11:56.789 --> 00:11:57.686
going forward.

00:11:57.686 --> 00:12:02.252
Like, you are in such a code red zone,

00:12:02.252 --> 00:12:06.398
that every minute, call it 18 hours a day

00:12:06.398 --> 00:12:07.978
out of 24,

00:12:07.978 --> 00:12:09.315
if you want this to be successful,

00:12:09.315 --> 00:12:11.641
need to allocated for your business,

00:12:11.641 --> 00:12:15.200
even at the mercy in year
one of your family time.

00:12:16.667 --> 00:12:19.305
Even at the mercy of that, and so,

00:12:19.305 --> 00:12:21.897
I guess what I'm getting at
and you could tell by my tone

00:12:21.897 --> 00:12:24.719
and vibe on this question, is I'm scared,

00:12:24.719 --> 00:12:25.953
